{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は自分が担当する", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472949.897586}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "担当するの丁寧", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472950.454202}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は使役形プラスでいただきます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472955.4382632}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は自分の好意を丁寧に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472957.8058035}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "相手に伝えてる、伝える場面に使う表現です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472962.359547}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ば", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472964.3442986}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こちらで待たせていただきます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472967.196959}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "で待ちますではなくて、ここで待たせていただきますだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472972.1965644}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "丁寧に自分の好意を相手に報告しています。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472976.8439806}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "し注意点があります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472981.7972324}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "動詞のて形いただきます。これだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472985.0188882}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "その行為は相手になってしまいます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472987.084178}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "担当していただきますだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472992.0666893}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "相手に依頼する表現になってしまうので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472995.7148}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ここは注意が必要です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783472996.866989}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自分の行為の場合は使役", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473001.0981157}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "でいただきますを使いましょう", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473004.0551975}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、それでは会話です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473009.061235}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "次の会話は、担当交代の挨拶の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473012.2563443}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "会話になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473013.07191}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では、今回も皆さんリピートしてくだい。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473017.1504273}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "もお世話になっております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473020.234037}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この度、御社の担当が変わりましたので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473025.2469375}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後任の者を連れてご愛", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473030.2058969}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "挨拶に参りました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473031.5892494}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "はご丁寧に恐れ入ります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473036.6005857}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473041.5880892}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "私の後任のチン・シュウメイでございます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473044.209299}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "私同様よろしくお願", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473049.2324045}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473050.4912212}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "たび", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473055.4209998}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "御社を担当させていただくことになりました。チンでございます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473058.8225238}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "あ、チンさんですか。木村でございます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473066.1715572}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473071.17748}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "精一杯頑張りますので、こちらこそよろしくお願いいします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473079.008444}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ではもう一度内容を確認しましょう。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473085.7920446}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は、担当交代の挨拶", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473089.493331}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の会話になります。登場人物は三人", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473094.5352614}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "永井さん木村さん、珍さんの三人になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473098.4289253}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は永井さんがいつもお世話になっております", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473103.418613}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "と会話を始めていますが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473105.4968436}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "実はこの度御社の担当が変わりましたので、こう", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473110.5042439}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "任の者を連れてご挨拶に回りました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473115.170915}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後任、これの意味は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473119.3056266}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後の任務者、えー、後の担当者ということですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473122.5845916}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後任の者を連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473127.3993955}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ですから", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473128.2256045}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "つまり永井さんは前任者", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473133.2152436}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、今まで担当していた人ということになります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473136.2994025}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は新しい担当者、後の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473141.2051313}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "任務者の人を連れて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473143.0805278}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一緒に二人で挨拶に来たという場面ですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473148.1042027}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に対して木村さんが、それはご丁寧に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473152.6880217}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "恐れ入ります", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473153.5272665}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "恐れ入ります。これはすみませんの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473158.716572}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "丁寧ですね。すみませんの謙譲語になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473162.7717242}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "恐れ入ります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473163.6178555}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "わざわざ挨拶に来てくれた", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473168.577535}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ことに対して、あ、それはわざわざ丁寧に来てくださっ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473172.3263245}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "てありがとうございますという表現になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473175.135535}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "から永井さん、こちらが私の後任の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473180.2347624}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "陳氏名でございます私同様よろしくお願いいします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473185.0605035}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、漢字は私", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473190.0527604}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ですが、私とも読みますね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473193.4446132}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "私より私の方が、より", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473196.553668}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "謙譲語になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473199.9797904}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "もちろん私でも問題ありません。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473203.0152717}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "から次、チンさん。この度御社を担当させていただい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473207.2022295}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ことになりました。チンでございます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473209.920453}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "先ほどの談話の表現でもありましたね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473214.8296835}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "が担当することなので使役形", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473219.7269535}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "させていただくになります", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473222.341138}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "で、木村さん、あ、チンさんですか。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473226.9252896}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "木村でございます。どうぞよろしくお願いします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473229.1401663}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "精一杯がんばりますので、こちらこそよろしくお願いいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473234.1347632}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、これが会話の流れになります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473238.4192202}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では最後に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473243.3726091}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "改まった表現についてシェアしたいと思います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473245.8499203}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "改まった表現とは、日常会話", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473250.6508038}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の表現に比べて、より丁寧な表現になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473254.6172447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "仕事の場面や目上の人に使う場面には", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473259.5649266}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この改まった表現を使うことが多くありますね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473263.5659087}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "表をご覧ください。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473266.9950192}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は時間に関する言葉を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473271.9990513}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ピックアップしたんですが、よく", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473274.5256493}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "話す場合でもメールの場合でも使われる言葉なので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473279.538299}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ぜひ確認してくだい", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473282.8427212}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に発音して終わりたいと思います。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473287.884196}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ではこの改まった表現の発音からやりましょう。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473291.7675252}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "たび", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473293.1253874}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "本日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473295.6167305}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "明日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473297.5384705}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "明日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473299.4606435}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "昨日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473301.5833724}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "先日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473303.805109}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "翌日", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473305.6915793}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "先ほど、後ほど", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473309.8129694}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "いいですか", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473314.7882762}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。えー、もうこれは本当に仕事のメールでも", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473317.8253143}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.22.1-20260708-100412-b73888ed", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "よく使われる、よく見る", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783473320.8467126}
